; brushundo.eval - the brush by id, an erase of nothing, and the start square
; (code-review C352, C353, C348). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 34, on its
; scratch world.
;
; Every level of the scratch world starts with the same floor palette (temple,
; ancient stone, slabs, mossy cobble), so the script gives crypt1 and
; eval_arena DIFFERENT fifth entries first. The editor is paused throughout, so
; no monster walks onto a square the script erases.
;
;   --- browse ---    crypt1 gets floor_cobble as its 5th floor; eval_arena (the
;                     active level) gets floor_slate as ITS 5th, which arms it.
;                     Browsed to crypt1, the brush is still floor_slate: no row
;                     of crypt1's floors lights (crypt1 has no slate), and a
;                     click on 4,4 paints SLATE there - enrolled as crypt1's 6th.
;                     The brush was a row number: it lit crypt1's 5th row,
;                     floor_cobble, and painted that.
;   --- redo ---      eval_arena, active: a floor paint on 5,18, undone, then a
;                     middle-click erase of 7,18 (nothing on it, no override):
;                     refused, said as nothing to erase, and the redo still
;                     brings the paint back. The same on browsed crypt1's 5,5
;                     (its pinned floor erased first, so it holds nothing).
;   --- start ---     the party stepped off eval_arena's start (14,12): a wall
;                     painted there is refused and the square stays open; a
;                     wall rectangle over it raises the eight round it and keeps
;                     it, saying so once; crypt1, browsed, refuses a wall on its
;                     start 7,7 too.
;   --- crop ---      a crop of eval_arena that leaves out its start column, and
;                     one of crypt1 that leaves out its start row, are refused
;                     NAMING the start (the start was counted only as floor).
;   --- end ---

logecho on
reset
editor
editor pause on
editor palette catalog off
echo --- browse ---
levels view crypt1
editor palette add floors floor_cobble
levels view eval_arena
editor palette add floors floor_slate
editor palette items floors
levels view crypt1
editor palette items floors
editor levellist status
editor cell 4 4
editor ghost 4 4 0.5 0.5 click
editor cell 4 4
editor palette items floors
echo --- redo ---
levels view eval_arena
editor cell 5 18
editor records 7 18
editor place floors floor_slabs 5 18
editor cell 5 18
undo
editor cell 5 18
expect-refuse editor erase 7 18
redo
editor cell 5 18
levels view crypt1
editor records 5 5
editor erase 5 5
editor cell 5 5
editor place floors floor_slabs 5 5
editor cell 5 5
undo
editor cell 5 5
expect-refuse editor erase 5 5
redo
editor cell 5 5
echo --- start ---
levels view eval_arena
tp 12 12
expect-refuse editor place walls wall_marble 14 12
editor cell 14 12
editor fill walls wall_marble rect 13 11 15 13
editor cell 14 12
editor cell 13 12
editor cell 15 13
levels view crypt1
expect-refuse editor place walls wall_marble 7 7
editor cell 7 7
echo --- crop ---
levels view eval_arena
expect-refuse editor resize 0 0 14 24
levels view crypt1
expect-refuse editor resize 0 0 14 7
editor view
echo --- end ---
editor pause off
